# Sign-up funnel

The stages are ordered and each one is a subset of the one above it, which is
what makes the shape honest. The drop-offs are printed because the reader's
actual question — where do we lose them — is a subtraction the chart would
otherwise leave them to do.

```mdv funnel
title: Sign-up, last 30 days
category: step
value: users
orientation: vertical
showDropoff: true
format: table
---
step              | users
Visited           | 48210
Started sign-up   | 21440
Verified email    | 15980
Completed profile | 11220
Activated         |  8710
```
